 * E[t-1]; dt on the same minutes basis. Units: 1/min.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"1/min\"},\"standing_loss\":{\"default\":0.0,\"description\":\"Constant standing-loss power drawn by the storage system: reduces effective charging power and increases power drawn when discharging. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MW, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"storage_capacity\":{\"description\":\"Maximum storage capacity, e.g. MWh for batteries or liters for hydrogen. Divided by base_power gives an approximate duration at unity power factor. Units: per energy_units — MWH: MWh, MWMIN: MWmin .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"energy_units\",\"x-units\":{\"MWH\":\"MWh\",\"MWMIN\":\"MWmin\"}},\"storage_level_limits\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/MinMax\",\"description\":\"Minimum and maximum allowable storage levels [0, 1], usable to model derates or state-of-charge restrictions on cycling.\"},\"storage_target\":{\"default\":0.0,\"description\":\"Storage target at the end of simulation as ratio of storage capacity. Units: 1.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"Fraction\",\"x-unit\":\"1\"},\"storage_technology_type\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/StorageTech\",\"description\":\"Storage Technology Complementary to EIA 923.\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"name\",\"available\",\"bus\",\"prime_mover_type\",\"storage_technology_type\",\"storage_capacity\",\"storage_level_limits\",\"initial_storage_capacity_level\",\"rating\",\"active_power\",\"input_active_power_limits\",\"output_active_power_limits\",\"efficiency\",\"reactive_power\",\"base_power\",\"power_units\",\"operation_cost\"],\"title\":\"EnergyReservoirStorage\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"EnergyUnitBasis\":{\"description\":\"Unit basis a stored-energy quantity is recorded in. MWH: megawatt-hours, the default. MWMIN: megawatt-minutes, matching the minutes basis for operational durations.\",\"enum\":[\"MWH\",\"MWMIN\"],\"title\":\"EnergyUnitBasis\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"ExponentialLoad\":{\"\$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"A voltage-dependent ZIP load, most commonly used for dynamics modeling. Models active power as P = P0 * V^alpha and reactive power as Q = Q0 * V^beta. See StandardLoad for a three-part formulation, or PowerLoad for no voltage dependency.\",\"properties\":{\"active_power\":{\"description\":\"Active power coefficient, P0. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MW, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"alpha\":{\"description\":\"Exponent relating voltage dependency for active power. 0 = constant power only, 1 = constant current only, and 2 = constant impedance only.\",\"type\":\"number\"},\"available\":{\"description\":\"Whether the component is online (true) or offline (false). Unavailable components are excluded from simulations.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"base_power\":{\"description\":\"Base power of the unit for per unitization. Units: MVA.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MVA\"},\"beta\":{\"description\":\"Exponent relating voltage dependency for reactive power. 0 = constant power only, 1 = constant current only, and 2 = constant impedance only.\",\"type\":\"number\"},\"bus\":{\"description\":\"ID of the bus that this component is connected to.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"conformity\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/LoadConformity\",\"default\":\"UNDEFINED\",\"description\":\"Indicates whether the specified load is conforming or non-conforming.\"},\"dynamic_injector\":{\"description\":\"ID of the corresponding dynamic injection device, if any.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"id\":{\"description\":\"Unique integer identifier for this component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_active_power\":{\"description\":\"Maximum active power that this load can demand. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MW, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"max_reactive_power\":{\"description\":\"Maximum reactive power that this load can demand. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MVAr, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ReactivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MVAr\"}},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component. Unique among components of the same type; components of different types may share a name.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"power_units\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/UnitSystem\",\"description\":\"Unit basis for this component's power fields (power, ratings, ramp rates): COMPONENT_BASE per unit on base_power, NATURAL_UNITS the field's own unit.\"},\"reactive_power\":{\"description\":\"Reactive power coefficient, Q0. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MVAr, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ReactivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MVAr\"}}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"name\",\"available\",\"bus\",\"active_power\",\"reactive_power\",\"alpha\",\"beta\",\"base_power\",\"power_units\",\"max_active_power\",\"max_reactive_power\"],\"title\":\"ExponentialLoad\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"FACTSControlDevice\":{\"\$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"Facts control devices.\\n\\nMost often used in AC power flow studies as a control of voltage and, active and reactive power.\",\"properties\":{\"available\":{\"description\":\"Whether the component is online (true) or offline (false). Unavailable components are excluded from simulations.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"base_power\":{\"description\":\"System base power for per-unitization of this component's per-unit fields, recorded per component in lieu of a system-level table. Units: MVA.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MVA\"},\"bus\":{\"description\":\"Sending end bus number.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"control_mode\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/FACTSControlDeviceControlMode\",\"description\":\"Control mode. Used to describe the behavior of the control device.\"},\"dynamic_injector\":{\"description\":\"ID of the corresponding dynamic injection model for FACTS control device, if any.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"id\":{\"description\":\"Unique integer identifier for this component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_reactive_power\":{\"default\":9999.0,\"description\":\"Independent maximum reactive power ceiling: the device limit is the lesser of this value and the current/susceptance law. Non-binding at the 9999.0 default. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MVAr, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ReactivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MVAr\"}},\"max_shunt_current\":{\"description\":\"Maximum shunt current at the sending end bus; entered at unity voltage. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MVA, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ApparentPower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MVA\"}},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component. Unique among components of the same type; components of different types may share a name.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"power_units\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/UnitSystem\",\"description\":\"Unit basis for this component's power fields (power, ratings, ramp rates): COMPONENT_BASE per unit on base_power, NATURAL_UNITS the field's own unit.\"},\"reactive_power_required\":{\"description\":\"Total reactive power required to hold voltage at sending bus, as a fraction in the range 0-1. Units: 1.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"Fraction\",\"x-unit\":\"1\"},\"regulated_bus_number\":{\"default\":0,\"description\":\"Bus whose voltage this device regulates; 0 means local (sending) bus (PSS/E FCREG). Units: 1.\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"x-quantity\":\"Dimensionless\",\"x-unit\":\"1\"},\"shunt_control_type\":{\"default\":\"STATCOM\",\"description\":\"Device class selecting the reactive-limit law (SVC vs STATCOM).\",\"enum\":[\"SVC\",\"STATCOM\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"voltage_setpoint\":{\"description\":\"Voltage setpoint at the sending end bus in kV, it has to be a `PV` bus. Units: kV. Units: per voltage_setpoint_units — NATURAL_UNITS: kV, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"Voltage\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"voltage_setpoint_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"kV\"}},\"voltage_setpoint_units\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/VoltageUnitBasis\",\"default\":\"COMPONENT_BASE\",\"description\":\"Unit basis for voltage_setpoint. COMPONENT_BASE (pu on the bus base voltage) is PSS/E RAW native (VSET).\"}},\"required\":[\"name\",\"id\",\"available\",\"bus\",\"max_shunt_current\",\"reactive_power_required\",\"voltage_setpoint\",\"base_power\",\"power_units\"],\"title\":\"FACTSControlDevice\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"FACTSControlDeviceControlMode\":{\"description\":\"Operating mode of a FACTS control device. OOS: both series and shunt links open. NML: both links operating. BYP: series link bypassed as a zero-impedance line; shunt link operates as a reactive-only STATCOM.\",\"en