-12/schema\",\"description\":\"Association between a power plant supplemental attribute and a generating unit, identifying the unit's group within the plant: shafts, penstocks, PCCs, or exclusion groups. group_index semantics depend on the parent plant's type.\",\"properties\":{\"entity_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the generating unit (entity) participating in the plant\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"group_index\":{\"description\":\"Group number within the plant (shaft, penstock, PCC, or exclusion group, depending on the parent plant's type)\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"plant_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the parent plant supplemental attribute\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"plant_id\",\"entity_id\",\"group_index\"],\"title\":\"PlantAssociation\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"PointToPointBid\":{\"\$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"A priced point-to-point spread bid (e.g. an up-to-congestion or PTP obligation bid): a willingness-to-pay curve on the price spread between two locations. Clears as a withdrawal at the source terminal and an injection at the sink terminal.\",\"properties\":{\"available\":{\"description\":\"Indicator of whether the bid is available for market clearing (`true`) or not (`false`).\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"from_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the source terminal (withdrawal side), resolved through the entity registry: a topology record or a trading hub.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"Unique integer identifier for this component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"linked_crr\":{\"description\":\"Identifier of a linked congestion-right instrument, when the market couples the bid to one.\",\"type\":[\"string\",\"null\"]},\"max_active_power\":{\"description\":\"MW envelope for the bid. Units: MW.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MW\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component. Unique among components of the same type; components of different types may share a name.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"p