wer for per unitization for primary-secondary windings. Units: MVA.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MVA\"},\"base_power_23\":{\"description\":\"Base power for per unitization for secondary-tertiary windings. Units: MVA.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MVA\"},\"base_power_31\":{\"description\":\"Base power for per unitization for tertiary-primary windings. Units: MVA.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MVA\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"Unique integer identifier for this component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"magnetizing_shunt\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/ComplexNumber\",\"default\":{\"imag\":0.0,\"real\":0.0},\"description\":\"Magnetizing shunt admittance referenced to the primary circuit's base voltage. Units: per admittance_units — NATURAL_UNITS: S, COMPONENT_MVAR: MVAr, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"x-quantity\":\"Susceptance\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"admittance_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"COMPONENT_MVAR\":\"MVAr\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"S\"}},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component. Unique among components of the same type; components of different types may share a name.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"parameter_units\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-93346ccf4b7969b6d994.json#/components/schemas/ImpedanceUnitBasis\",\"default\":\"COMPONENT_BASE\",\"description\":\"Unit basis for the pairwise measured impedance fields (r_12, x_12, r_23, x_23, r_31, x_31). One basis governs all three winding pairs.\"},\"primary_circuit\":{\"description\":\"The primary `TransformerCircuit` connecting the primary bus to the star bus.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"r_12\":{\"description\":\"Measured resistance, referenced to the primary winding's base voltage, from primary to secondary windings (R1-2 in PSS/E). Units: per parameter_units — NATURAL_UNITS: ohm, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"Resistance\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"parameter_units\",\"x-unit